From c9d6fc44cab051f188fcd6aff2a4a0a99a5e7547 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henson <henson@local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:48:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] M-C3a: park-disk tier under the parked-conversation cache
 (STRATA_PARK_DISK=DIR, off by default) - evict_oldest() hands the full victim
 image to ParkDisk before its RAM goes; admission with no usable RAM match
 reads the deepest disk prefix back (identity-bound STRSES v1 via
 conversation_file.cpp: fingerprints, bounded parse, payload hashes, RAM
 preflight, temp+rename publish) and restores it through the normal
 conversation-snapshot take path; disk budget (STRATA_PARK_DISK_MIB) +
 keep-free guard (STRATA_PARK_DISK_MIN_FREE_MIB default 4096) evict
 oldest-first; folder 0700 files 0600; boot scan revalidates and deletes
 foreign/corrupt files; pinned prefixes and the guarded donor never reach the
 tier; drop_superseded/clear never spill; full-copy for now (M-C3b dedups via
 segment-view files)

